# A gripped part slips out while carried: the fingers (pressing at the
# current limit, commanded 1.2 mm inside the part) close on past it by more
# than lost_tol: LOST, LinuxCNC turns the machine off (off_reason 7).
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate_gripper.arm
@include arm/tests/inc_grip_pick.txt
grip expect 30 2.0 0 0 0.15
grip close
run 1.5
tlmove 1.0 799.3 0 1370.9 0 0 0
run 1.2
tmove 2.0 30 10 10 0 -80 0
run 0.8
print grip off
gripdrop
run 0.5
print grip off
@expect arm.grip_state[1] == 2
@expect arm.off_reason[1] == 0
@expect arm.grip_state[2] == 6
@expect arm.grip_held[2] == -1
@expect arm.off_reason[2] == 7
@reject ^ERROR
